Get that, but the rules specify that "The game does not end if an Environment's "Game Over" condition occurs. Instead, all cards from that Environment's Deck are removed from the game, regardless of what Battle Zone they are in. It might be yet another exception but the rules are pretty clear that it kills all the cards of the deck it belongs too no matter where they are so I don't think you can have the Representative die twice.

